 W906_PanelHomeKeyArm) through IMotorAccessBackend::GoldenHomeAll; refused
 while a jog / single home runs or during manual teach / SystemStart; on
 'armed' the live backend closes the Teach page (golden MainProc returns while
 fTeach is shown) so the golden home sequence (Z first, then XY) starts. (2)
 Main-screen soft panel keys: WS panel.key
 <START|PAUSE|HOME|RESET|ONECYCLE|CLEANOUT|TRAYFEED|TRAYEND|ALARMRESET|RETRY|SKIP>
 queues one key id that ScanPannelKey returns (W906_VirtualPanelKeyHook, after
 golden's SystemInitialOK / SafeLock / employee-ID refusals) to the first key
 reader -- golden ScanKey, the Home PAUSE hook, the alarm/message waits --
 i.e. one physical press; unread keys expire in 3 s. EastSun 1003 'physical
 buttons cannot communicate, need software buttons'

